\title{empleR: Tools for Analyzing Peru's National Employment Surveys (EPEN/EPE)}
\description{
Provides tools to download, read, and analyze microdata from Peru's national employment surveys: the Encuesta Permanente de Empleo Nacional (EPEN, 2022-present) and its predecessor the Encuesta Permanente de Empleo (EPE, until 2021). Key features include automatic harmonization of occupational classifiers (CNO 2015 and CO-95), calculation of weighted labor market indicators with optional experimental survey-design inference, EPEN departmental-domain maps, and integration with an AI occupational exposure index.
